{
  "$doc": "docs/DESIGN_Scenario_Regression.md §3 — CE-4035 G-10: night shortens sight (150 x 0.25 = ~38 m). From the header's Judge: each observer's memory is empty while his target is beyond 75 m, and holds him later. ⚠ reads TargetMemory.Count (any modality, the old check filtered Visual only) and the dump of that struct is not verified.",
